[I] An open source camera stack and framework for Linux, Android, and ChromeOS

[T] A complex camera support library for Linux, Android, and ChromeOS
[T] the Linux media community is collaborating with the industry to develop a
[T] camera stack that is open-source-friendly while still protecting vendor
[T] core IP. libcamera was born out of that collaboration and offers modern
[T] camera support to Linux-based systems, including traditional
[T] Linux distributions, ChromeOS and Android.

[U] https://libcamera.org/

[A] libcamera Team
[M] Daniel Ashkenazi <daniel.ashkenazi@gmail.com>

